{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14324020","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14324020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1432402001:0":{"text":"비가 오기 전에 비가림막 좀 설치해 달라고 그렇게 말했는데! 이러면 망하잖아!","source_cn":"我早就说该给我拨款修个雨棚，要不然一下雨这些木材都得完蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA953E7314BE404CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1432402002:0":{"text":"아, 그래. 망한건 목재뿐만이 아니지, 나도 망할거야!","source_cn":"这下好了，完蛋的不光有木材，还有我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE1317DBAC0E1F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1432402003:0":{"text":"누가 좀 마법 같은 걸 써서라도 도와줬으면... 하아, 또 말도 안 되는 꿈을 꾸고 있네 내가...","source_cn":"要是有人能帮帮我，施个魔法什么的……唉，我又在做梦了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87DB575F150B0DA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:监工诺力":{"text":"현장 감독 노리","source":"监工诺力","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}